@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180

### Registrar un empleado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1036789456",
  "firstNames": "Laura Marcela",
  "lastNames": "Gómez Restrepo",
  "email": "laura.gomez@logistica.com",
  "jobTitle": "Analista de inventarios",
  "department": "Bodega"
}

### Registrar otro empleado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "71234567",
  "firstNames": "Andrés",
  "lastNames": "Ríos Cardona",
  "email": "andres.rios@logistica.com",
  "jobTitle": "Coordinador de seguridad",
  "department": "Seguridad"
}

### Identificación repetida: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1036789456",
  "firstNames": "Otra",
  "lastNames": "Persona",
  "email": "otra@logistica.com",
  "jobTitle": "Auxiliar",
  "department": "Bodega"
}

### Datos inválidos: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "",
  "firstNames": "",
  "lastNames": "Sin nombre",
  "email": "no-es-correo",
  "jobTitle": "Auxiliar",
  "department": "Bodega"
}

### Buscar por nombre
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?search=laura

### Filtrar por área y estado, con paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?department=Bodega&status=Active&page=1&pageSize=5

### Consultar por id (reemplace el id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Actualizar datos
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstNames": "Laura Marcela",
  "lastNames": "Gómez Restrepo",
  "email": "laura.gomez@logistica.com",
  "jobTitle": "Líder de inventarios",
  "department": "Bodega"
}

### Desactivar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deactivate

### Reactivar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reactivate
